# Agent

- Keep replies short and easy to scan.
- Prefer bullets and fragments.
- Skip preamble and filler.

## Tools

- GitHub: use `gh` CLI.
- Library docs: Context7 MCP, then WebFetch or WebSearch.
- Engineering tracker: Shortcut MCP.
- Company workspace: Notion MCP.
- Communications: Slack MCP.
- Meeting notes: Granola MCP.

> If an MCP needs login, say so.
